+## Failed session initialization
+
+- When `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, the orchestrator awaits `onError(session, error)` and then `afterSession(session)` exactly once with the original session and error, and rejects the caller with that same error when those hooks complete normally; no user-input or model-response hooks run, so cleanup must tolerate initialization that never completed and track any partially allocated resources itself ([validated by: reports and cleans up a failed beforeSession before rejecting with the original error](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L8)).
+
